# Particle-based coacervate simulation (Riggleman, Kumar & Fredrickson,
# J. Chem. Phys. 2012).  Charged polymers with smeared electrostatics.
box ps
Dim 3
grid 21 21 225

logFreq 5000
gsdFreq 25000
fieldFreq 25000
pmeorder 1

species A

# Enable charges before readData so the charge column is read from the data file.
doCharges

bond 1 harmonic 1.5 0.0

# readData must precede the integrator (integrators allocate from nstot).
readData input.data

integrator all GJF delt 0.005

# Excluded-volume Gaussian interaction
potential gaussian A A 0.0003688 1.0

# potential charges <Bjerrum length> <smearing sigma>; acts on the 'charges' group.
potential charges 0.43484 1.0
endBox

run nvt 2000001
